; EditAbout -- WaveSmith's About window: Mason's picture (blended onto
; the window's background, its pens obtained from 16 colours up, borrowed
; below) beside the version and the credits. Right-Amiga ? opens it,
; WaveSmith goes on (it is modeless), Esc shuts it, Quit leaves nothing.
; DEV:Test/EditAbout.rexx reads the trace; grabs edit-about.ppm. Meant
; for each kind of screen:
;
;   gmake autotest T=EditAbout W=pal4 LIMIT=150    (4 colours: borrowed)
;   gmake autotest T=EditAbout W=pal LIMIT=150     (16: obtained)
;   gmake autotest T=EditAbout W=rtg32 LIMIT=150   (RTG, true colour)
FailAt 21
Wait 8
Delete >NIL: DEV:Test/about.trace DEV:Test/edit-about#? ENV:WaveSmith.prefs QUIET
Echo >DEV:Test/auto.log "EditAbout"
Version >>DEV:Test/auto.log DEV:sasc/WaveSmith FULL
SetEnv WaveSmithTrace DEV:Test/about.trace
Run >NIL: DEV:sasc/WaveSmith DEV:Test/Edit/Single.wav
Wait 10
RX DEV:Test/EditAbout.rexx
Wait 3
Echo >>DEV:Test/auto.log "still running:"
Status >>DEV:Test/auto.log COMMAND=DEV:sasc/WaveSmith
UnSetEnv WaveSmithTrace
Echo >DEV:Test/AutoDone done
